[I] Sailfish OS static device and SSU information tool and library

[T] ssu-sysinfo provides a command-line tool and a library for obtaining
[T] static SSU (Seamless Software Update) information on Sailfish OS, such
[T] as device model, designation, manufacturer and hardware features. It
[T] reads the configuration files directly, without requiring D-Bus IPC or
[T] the SSU daemon.

[U] https://github.com/sailfishos/ssu-sysinfo

[A] Ssu-sysinfo Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

